@base = http://localhost:5068

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### FR01 + FR02 search
GET {{base}}/api/products?keyword=Apple&sort=rating&minPrice=1000000&maxPrice=30000000

### FR03 detail
GET {{base}}/api/products/1

### FR04 reviews with images
GET {{base}}/api/products/1/reviews?hasImages=true&sort=newest

### FR05 flaws
GET {{base}}/api/products/1/flaws

### FR16 login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@flawfirst.local",
  "password": "User@123"
}

### FR16 register
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Phạm Demo",
  "email": "demo@flawfirst.local",
  "password": "Demo@123"
}
